Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.22,0:03:03.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能接受你跟我妹交往\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't-I can't go with the you-and-my-sister thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.89,0:03:06.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就是不能  那样太奇怪了  好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I just can't. It's just too weird, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.52,0:03:08.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一想到你们在一起  我就抓狂\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I imagine the two of you together, I freak out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.85,0:03:12.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会疯掉的  我受不了  我受不了  好了  好了  别激动\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It just freaks me out, and I can't do it. Okay, okay, okay. No-Yes. It's okay.
