Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.31,0:03:56.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我这学期可能会再开一堂课  好啊  现在就打给她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I may teach another class this semester. Yeah, do it now. Call her right now.
