Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.02,0:05:55.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请问一下  什么事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Excuse me. Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.73,0:05:57.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是菲比布非吗   是我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you Phoebe Buffay? Yeah.
