Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.37,0:06:12.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只想说  你真的很有天分\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I just wanna say I think you're really talented.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.66,0:06:15.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是因为崇拜我才这么说的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're just saying that because you're my biggest fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.96,0:06:19.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊   好好招呼那个人  他是个影迷\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey, listen, take good care of that guy. okay? He's a fan.
