Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.49,0:20:47.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇哦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.25,0:20:52.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我都不知道该说什么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't even know what to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.00,0:20:58.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.55,0:21:02.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不客气\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.60,0:21:10.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天哪   你在哭吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God, are you crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.02,0:21:14.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这两个人为何就是不能在一起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I just don't see why those two can't work things out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.28,0:21:22.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  我要走了  我要远离某个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, I'm leaving. I'm not gonna spend one more day...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.15,0:21:25.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一直害我的人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...with someone who's out to sabotage my every move.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.86,0:21:27.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是你   瑞秋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's you, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.16,0:21:29.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I got that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.95,0:21:33.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有你  我投怀送抱  你却不要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And you. I throw myself at you, and you say no?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.25,0:21:34.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你够同性恋的啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How gay are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.92,0:21:42.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你自己保重   吉儿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You take care, Jill.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.21,0:21:45.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  再见  再见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, see you. Bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.47,0:21:48.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,吉儿居然走了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't believe Jill's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.68,0:21:53.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我忍不住了  我一发不可收拾\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't help it. I opened a gate.
